# Build-time value, committed on purpose: a public fact about where the site points, not
# a secret. Vite only exposes VITE_*; nothing here is a credential.
#
# 040 §C.1 — the Students board is the LIVE Karka embed. This origin is the whole swap:
# set, the section builds path C1 (the real /embed/ route); unset, it falls back to the
# C2 muted loop at build time. The route shipped on CBSEPhysics11 main 486141c
# (2026-09-16) and is served from this CNAME.
VITE_KARKA_EMBED_ORIGIN=https://cbsephysics11.karkalabs.ai
